{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-p096a","title":"娄子伯献灌水筑沙城计","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-p096a-account","label":"《曹瞒传》","text":"《曹瞒传》记曹军渡渭屡受马超骑兵冲击，娄子伯建议夜筑沙城灌水，天明立成，使全军得渡。","evidence":["wudi-e-p096a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"采计渡军","evidence":["wudi-e-p096a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0169","role":"献计","evidence":["wudi-e-p096a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0282","role":"骑兵阻击","evidence":["wudi-e-p096a-q"]}],"place":{"text":"渭水","evidence":["wudi-e-p096a-q"]},"time":{"label":"西征渡渭时；本条称天寒","year":211,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-p096a-q","wudi-q-o128","wudi-q-b-2dc1a34b174874acae8b"],"chronology":"wudi-y211","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o128","basis":"西征渡渭时；本条称天寒","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,776,"P096a"],"order":322}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0169","name":"娄子伯","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0282","name":"马超","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-e-p096a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-01dcdfb2b607fccbf9c8","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝三﹞《曹瞒传》曰：“时公军每渡渭，辄为超骑所冲突，营不得立。地又多沙，不可筑垒。娄子伯说公曰：‘今天寒，可起沙为城，以水灌之，可一夜而成。’公从之，乃多作缣囊以运水，夜渡兵作城。比明，城立，由是公军，尽得渡渭。”","attribution":"《曹瞒传》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":100,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-6a6d3fc77ffa41b4e2e8","start":0,"end":107,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-2dc1a34b174874acae8b","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-2dc1a34b174874acae8b","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗十六年：建安十六年（公元 211）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":54,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-889c5acff5776ef2f54b","start":0,"end":21,"offset_un